  "name": "On the Hunt",
  "description": "Press your Primary Ability key to enter §e§lOn the Hunt§r for 30 seconds, gaining +25% movement speed, attack speed, mining speed, and melee damage while sensing creatures within 64 blocks. Undetectable creatures cannot be revealed.\n \n§e§lMark of Fenrir:§r\nSneak and hold Primary Ability while focusing on a valid target. Stalking reduces your movement speed by 75% only while you maintain focus. After 5 seconds, the target is marked for 30 seconds, revealed to you unless Undetectable, and takes 25% more damage from you."
